  "number": 5942,
  "title": "Cancel superseded pull request validation runs and retry transient CI failures",
  "body": "> Pull request validation fails on transient infrastructure errors.\n\n## Changelog Entry\n\n### Changed\n\n- 👷🏻 Pull request validation now cancels superseded runs, retries `npm clean-install` and `docker compose build`, bounds the Selenium Grid wait and HTML test jobs, keeps build artifacts for 3 days for re-runs, and no longer fails merging test results on re-run, in PR [#5942](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/5942), by [@OEvgeny](https://github.com/OEvgeny)\n\n## Description\n\nIn 285 runs, 11 jobs failed on registry errors, expired artifacts or empty re-runs, and superseded runs kept running. Only `pull-request-validation.yml` changes.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- `concurrency` per pull request, `cancel-in-progress`: 55 superseded runs, 17 pushes ran twice (e.g. 39513974960, 39513975524)\n- `npm clean-install`: up to 3 attempts, E502/ECONNRESET: 117897688457, 118276587417, 118822867621\n- `docker compose build`: up to 3 attempts, mcr.microsoft.com 503: 118981881108\n- Selenium Grid wait: `timeout-minutes: 3`, unbounded today (max 6 s)\n- HTML test job: `timeout-minutes: 30`, default 6 hours (max 639 s)\n- `docker` and `tarballs` artifacts: `retention-days: 3`, re-run after 27 hours failed: 118947250337, 118947570638, 118948571058\n- \"Merge test result artifacts\": `continue-on-error` like \"Merge test snapshots\", re-runs found no `test-result-*`: 118947327636, 118947639621, 118948631608, 118946942025\n\n- [ ] I have added tests and executed them locally\n- [x] I have added `.changelog/<PR#>-<slug>.md`\n- [ ] I have updated documentation\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [ ] Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)\n- [ ] Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed\n- [ ] CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)\n- [ ] Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)\n- [ ] Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)\n- [ ] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [ ] Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)\n- [ ] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\n",
